# Upstream C libraries - not ours, never reviewed, never edited.
# 778 files / 13.7 MB of libwebp, libvpx, dav1d, libvorbis, dr_flac, carquet.
# A single broad grep or Read across these is a ~3.4M token mistake.
Sources/CWebP/
Sources/CVPX/
Sources/CDAV1D/
Sources/CVORBIS/
Sources/CFLAC/
Sources/CCARQUET/

# Build output (also in .gitignore; repeated so Read and Bash are covered too).
.build/
.swiftpm/
DerivedData/
dist/

# Binary assets - no code review needs the bytes, only the reference to them.
*.png

# NOTE: two large-but-legitimately-readable files are NOT ignored here, because
# localization and media-test work genuinely need them:
#   Sources/NeoCore/Resources/Localizable.xcstrings   355 KB (~89k tokens)
#   Tests/NeoTests/MediaFixtures.swift                 309 KB (~77k tokens)
# The project CLAUDE.md tells Claude to read these with offset/limit instead.
